WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.020
Hello everybody!

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.580
My name is Markiplier and welcome to Terror Lab.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.080
[Boop]

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.260
Flashbang ready.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.100
[SHWOP]

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.380
Good god, man! What did I do?

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.040
'Time to recover memory'?

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:10.680
[whimpering] I don't-

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.680
AHH! WHAT THE FUCK!

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.720
[Garbled monster noises] HI!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.180
WELCOME TO THE PARTY, BRO!

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.080
YOU'RE LATE! WHERE'S THE, CHICKS, MAN?

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.080
[Unfitting cheerful music plays]

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.000
[Drum sounds]

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.900
[Mutual confusion]

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.400
[Blinks]

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.780
... I'm gonna call you Chad.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:27.280
[BOOP]

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.180
And I don't wanna talk about holes when I'm...

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.160
around you, Chad.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.820
You know, tho- it was just an experimental time in college, Chad!

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.180
We were just having a bromance and you- you made it all weird, CHAD!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.660
You make me feel things that I don't wanna FEEL!

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.140
You make me think about times that I don't wanna think about anymore...

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.140
All of our BRO moments!

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:47.240
Our BROments!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.340
WE HAD A GREAT TIME BRO-ING OUT IN THE-

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.100
br-b-

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.760
BROODS!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.600
THAT'S 'WOODS' IN BROSPEAK!

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.100
[BOOP]

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.760
We used to have good times back in our early party days.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:56.760
And I know!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.560
I know Stacy got in between both of us!

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.640
Literally AND figuratively!

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.140
[BOOP]

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.620
Hey Chad, you got a little closer than I thought!

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.920
Just like back in college!

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.800
WHY CAN'T I QUIT YOU!?

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.120
*sob* Why can't I quit you, Cha-

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.700
I thought this was a door, I thought I was making a dramatic exit there.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.640
HABPTH!

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.320
[First video] Again, that does not help anybody, it just blinds me.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.060
I'm flash-banging myself.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.060
[Second video]
He'll never see me coming!

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.600
AHHH! I had you!

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.860
Don't swath away!

